WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
Choose a posture that feels sufficiently supported.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.800
This practice does not ask you to produce warmth, forgiveness, or any special emotion.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.910
It offers a way to speak to yourself without adding unnecessary harm.

4
00:00:22.106 --> 00:00:26.296
Notice the points where the body is held by a chair, bed, floor, or cushion.

5
00:00:27.996 --> 00:00:30.246
Let support be a fact before it becomes a feeling.

6
00:00:47.321 --> 00:00:51.411
Bring to mind that you are a person having this particular moment.

7
00:00:53.111 --> 00:00:56.721
You do not need to summarize your life or decide whether the moment is good or bad.

8
00:01:13.796 --> 00:01:18.486
Notice one area of strain, tiredness, or ordinary difficulty.

9
00:01:20.186 --> 00:01:24.586
Choose something manageable rather than the most painful experience available.

10
00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:28.686
You can return to neutral sensation at any time.

11
00:01:49.177 --> 00:01:56.087
See whether you can name the difficulty simply: this is tiring, this hurts, this is uncertain, or this is a lot.

12
00:01:57.787 --> 00:02:00.277
Use words that feel true rather than dramatic.

13
00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:25.377
Now try a steady response: may I meet this moment without turning against myself.

14
00:02:27.077 --> 00:02:30.707
If that wording does not fit, use: I can be on my own side for this breath.

15
00:02:54.612 --> 00:02:57.722
Listen to the phrase as sound and meaning.

16
00:02:59.422 --> 00:03:01.572
You do not have to believe it completely.

17
00:03:03.272 --> 00:03:06.332
Let it be an offered direction rather than a test.

18
00:03:26.822 --> 00:03:32.432
Place a hand where contact feels grounding, perhaps on the chest, arm, or thigh.

19
00:03:34.132 --> 00:03:35.802
Or keep both hands where they are.

20
00:03:37.502 --> 00:03:41.152
Touch is optional and does not make the practice more real.

21
00:04:01.643 --> 00:04:03.963
Feel one breath beneath or near that contact.

22
00:04:05.663 --> 00:04:09.133
On the exhale, release only what releases naturally.

23
00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:13.833
Kindness does not require the body to relax on command.

24
00:04:37.738 --> 00:04:42.858
Offer another believable phrase: may I give myself the same basic consideration I would give someone who is trying.

25
00:04:44.558 --> 00:04:47.048
Adjust the words until they sound honest.

26
00:05:14.368 --> 00:05:20.888
Perhaps resistance appears: I do not deserve this, these words are false, or this is uncomfortable.

27
00:05:22.588 --> 00:05:25.038
Notice resistance without making it an enemy.

28
00:05:26.738 --> 00:05:29.708
You might say: resistance is allowed to be here too.

29
00:05:53.613 --> 00:05:55.863
Return to the supporting surface.

30
00:05:57.563 --> 00:06:00.283
Feel how it holds weight without asking for an explanation.

31
00:06:01.983 --> 00:06:04.093
Let physical support accompany the words.

32
00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:33.084
Recall one recent effort, however small: getting through a difficult hour, answering a message, resting, beginning again, or showing up now.

33
00:06:34.784 --> 00:06:37.204
Acknowledge the effort without inflating it.

34
00:07:01.109 --> 00:07:02.669
Try: this effort counts.

35
00:07:04.369 --> 00:07:06.509
Or: I can recognize what I carried.

36
00:07:08.209 --> 00:07:12.309
Notice whether either phrase feels useful, neutral, or not right today.

37
00:07:36.214 --> 00:07:39.704
If no phrase works, let kindness take the form of less pressure.

38
00:07:41.404 --> 00:07:45.104
For several breaths, stop demanding a result from this practice.

39
00:08:15.839 --> 00:08:18.169
Notice the tone of your inner voice now.

40
00:08:19.869 --> 00:08:21.559
You are not required to make it sweet.

41
00:08:23.259 --> 00:08:26.669
Aim for clear, respectful, and no harsher than necessary.

42
00:08:50.575 --> 00:08:55.195
Offer one final sentence for the next part of the day: may I take the next workable step.

43
00:08:56.895 --> 00:08:59.575
Let the step remain modest and specific.

44
00:09:20.065 --> 00:09:22.435
Widen attention to the whole body and the room.

45
00:09:24.135 --> 00:09:25.535
Release any hand placement.

46
00:09:27.235 --> 00:09:32.055
Hear sounds and notice light while keeping a thread of respectful attention toward yourself.

47
00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.520
Move when you are ready.

48
00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:54.230
Kindness here was not a mood you had to achieve.

49
00:09:55.930 --> 00:10:00.000
It was the practice of meeting difficulty without becoming another source of it.
